    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WELCOME TO HORROR NIGHT!</strong></h2>Find your way out from an abandoned mansion by solving puzzles, hiding from a horrifying creature, and working in team, in a new <i>multiplayer, third person, horror</i> experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiplayer Videogame</strong></h2>Escape alongside your friends and <strong>don't let the creature catch them! </strong><br>Get rewarded by helping your teammates, solving puzzles and working in team.<br>Revive all survivors by bringing their skulls into the resurrection ritual! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/3e61a4e151e406c1299d99f7c5e5bc1f.poster.avif?t=1732666899\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/3e61a4e151e406c1299d99f7c5e5bc1f.webm?t=1732666899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/3e61a4e151e406c1299d99f7c5e5bc1f.mp4?t=1732666899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play as the Creature</strong></h2><br>Choose your favorite skin, improve your skills by eating rats, and crouch for better speed <i>to catch all survivors.</i><br>Hunt down every single one of them <i>to become winner!</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/a1a58d5749e386255c876057b2843036.poster.avif?t=1732666899\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/a1a58d5749e386255c876057b2843036.webm?t=1732666899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/a1a58d5749e386255c876057b2843036.mp4?t=1732666899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Solve Puzzles to Escape the Mansion</strong></h2><br>Escape by solving <i>randomized puzzles</i> in the mansion, or simply completing a hidden ritual that will get you out of the mansion. <br>[Not all clues will lead to something]. <i>Teamwork is essential!</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customization</strong></h2><i>As a Survivor:</i> Customize your character by choosing from a variety of hairstyles, outfits, accesories, lamps and much more!<br><i>As the Monster:</i> Select the scariest skin to hunt all players down! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/e449916a9802c67aa772ebd14eb7ded5.poster.avif?t=1732666899\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/e449916a9802c67aa772ebd14eb7ded5.webm?t=1732666899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/e449916a9802c67aa772ebd14eb7ded5.mp4?t=1732666899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/d105e3b4e165c7677dc4999e8464a20d.poster.avif?t=1732666899\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/d105e3b4e165c7677dc4999e8464a20d.webm?t=1732666899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/d105e3b4e165c7677dc4999e8464a20d.mp4?t=1732666899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Progress</strong></h2>Unlock new items by levelling up! (<i>You can also acquire them on the official Horror Night Store</i>)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/89a4d7338194b32dd17fad6ea3dcd483.poster.avif?t=1732666899\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/89a4d7338194b32dd17fad6ea3dcd483.webm?t=1732666899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/89a4d7338194b32dd17fad6ea3dcd483.mp4?t=1732666899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>New Lobby</strong></h2>Waiting for your friends to join a match is no longer tedious ;) You'll be able to explore much more terrifying surroundings while doing so, and even speed up the game by simply pressing the new &quot;force start match&quot; lever. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/ea3dd7add87ba717b1e32b6896077213.poster.avif?t=1732666899\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/ea3dd7add87ba717b1e32b6896077213.webm?t=1732666899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/ea3dd7add87ba717b1e32b6896077213.mp4?t=1732666899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><strong>Character Selection</strong></strong></h2>Play as the monster or as a survivor in this <i>Free to Play</i> asymmetric version, by throwing yourself into the <i>Well Of Doom</i>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/415a02b6141fdca04d1665ae0726e389.poster.avif?t=1732666899\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/415a02b6141fdca04d1665ae0726e389.webm?t=1732666899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/415a02b6141fdca04d1665ae0726e389.mp4?t=1732666899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Improved Interaction</strong></h2>Interacting with objects is now faster and easier. Just by pressing E! ;)<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/f5b719e66edcce6c27f8b142d5bb40df.poster.avif?t=1732666899\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/f5b719e66edcce6c27f8b142d5bb40df.webm?t=1732666899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/f5b719e66edcce6c27f8b142d5bb40df.mp4?t=1732666899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Teleportation</strong></h2>Escape from the Ayuwoki's clutches even faster through <i>portals and wardrobes. </i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>New <i>Horror Night</i> Store</strong></h2>Acquire new items in the <i>official store,</i> by either shopping with real cash (buying gold coins), or simply by completing different missions and objectives within the game, to earn silver coins.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/c39466ae60acfd2a9891684f3960ca6e.poster.avif?t=1732666899\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/c39466ae60acfd2a9891684f3960ca6e.webm?t=1732666899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721350/extras/c39466ae60acfd2a9891684f3960ca6e.mp4?t=1732666899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
